DCP I3 local laboratory integration

This repository records and applies a local integration to Agent Orchestrator,
Copyright 2026 Untrivial, licensed under the Apache License 2.0. The exact
upstream license is preserved in third_party/agent-orchestrator/LICENSE.

The official upstream source is fetched outside Git at the release pinned in
upstream/agent-orchestrator.lock. DCP modifies only Electron userData path
selection through the exact patch in patches/agent-orchestrator/, with the
changed files and tests visible in that patch. The repository-owned launcher
and curator adapter are separate DCP-authored integration code.

No upstream binary is redistributed by this repository. Agent Orchestrator
keeps its upstream product identity in the local source-run lab. Apache-2.0
does not grant trademark rights.
